{
  "id": 2050,
  "name": "steel-bottle-r",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプにも　使われる　定番の水筒。熱を通しにくい　ステンレスなので優れた保温と　保冷機能を　ほこる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프에도 사용하는 정석적인 보틀. 열이 잘 통하지 않는 스테인리스 소재라 보온 및 보냉 성능이 뛰어나다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露營時也能使用的標準款水壺。以不易導熱的不銹鋼製成，具備優秀的保溫和保冷效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une gourde parfois utilisée pour faire du camping. L’acier inoxydable isole son contenu et lui permet de garder vos boissons chaudes ou froides à température.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese klassische Trinkflasche eignet sich auch fürs Camping. Ihr wärmedämmender Edelstahl verlangsamt die Abkühlung oder Erwärmung von Getränken merklich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este termo resulta útil tanto en pícnics como acampadas, pues conserva muy bien la temperatura en su interior gracias al acero inoxidable aislante del que está hecho.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Borraccia classica usata anche per il campeggio. Realizzata in acciaio inox dall’elevata capacità termoisolante, mantiene bene sia il caldo che il freddo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A go-to bottle sometimes used while camping. The stainless steel keeps the temperature inside steady, making it great for keeping drinks hot or cold.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプにも　使われる　定番の水筒。熱を通しにくい　ステンレスなので優れた保温と　保冷機能を　ほこる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营时也会使用到的标准款水壶。以不易导热的不锈钢制成，具备极佳的保温保冷功能。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
